Macropad contest is here! Sep 12 – Sep 15







>From September 12–15, we’re inviting you to design your own custom macropad in Womp. Whether it’s minimalist, retro, or a wild
gamer rig.
If it clicks, it counts. ✅
 
How to join:
 
 * ✅ Design your macropad in Womp - keep product design in mind!

 * Publish it with #MacropadChallenge to earn an exclusive badge

 * Share it on our Reddit [https://www.reddit.com/r/womp3d/]



Prizes:
 
 * Community Favorite → chosen by Reddit upvotes

 * Staff Spotlight → picked by Team Womp

 * Each winner gets $100 in 3D printing credits

 




When:

 
Sep 12 – Sep 15 | 12PM EST
 



 
 

 
 

Join Now! [https://beta.womp.com/]

 





We’re excited to see your creations with Womp!
Don’t forget to tag us and give us a follow!
 

